==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|head=[[dumb]] [[terminal]]}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} A [[computer]] terminal consisting of a [[monitor]] (usually in [[monochrome]]) and [[keyboard]], but (unlike a [[personal computer]]) having almost no [[processing]] [[capability]], used to provide [[input]] to and receive [[output]] from a [[remote]] [[server]], [[minicomputer]], or [[mainframe]].

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|computer terminal}}
* {{l|en|thin client}}

